{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_title", "source_sha256": "5af0c1f0ae4581258c50f523f5b1e8b0475d54766202466bfa2120cbd8e0a45c", "ja": "特別ではない日", "zh": "非特别的日子", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_synopsis", "source_sha256": "164daf11361d2c49f613e76bef55e0b828bba0fb42a38438cfa910fd702cd8a8", "ja": "ある賞の受賞に伴い、定期公演に特別な\nお客さんが来ることに。星梨花は「いつもと\n同じ公演でいいのか」と疑問を持つが、アイ\nドル達は普段から頑張っていると気づき、\n『いつもどおり』のかけがえのなさを知る。", "zh": "因为荣获了某个奖项，定期公演将迎来特别的\n客人。虽然星梨花心生疑问：“照平常那样演\n出就可以了吗？”，但意识到偶像们平时就一直在\n努力后，明白了“一如既往”也是无可替代的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1000_null", "source_sha256": "9ae402f0bd63d4e5669b21d53d4c788695a03bf42b7cfd4c710d427175d5f399", "ja": "1週間後……", "zh": "1周后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b7cf869829048f383b997c8b2aaffb23045cd2ee37f12a930c93a3ef5050ff39", "ja": "（今日から、定期公演のレッスン開始だ。公演では、\n星梨花の新曲をお披露目する予定なんだけど……）", "zh": "（定期公演的排练从今天开始。公演上预计会首次披露星梨花的新歌，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "a5c852c9d4732136aab1e603ed3d41d3a53731aba290d68f5b314b5c384e540f", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n今日は、遅い……ね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n今天来得好晚……呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "eca1cd5e6f7d48d709dc1d2ae6ea3685965d9ee7b06bc162d68e0e0ef2e69b89", "ja": "遅刻なんて珍しいけど、なにかあったのかな？", "zh": "迟到还真少见，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c3213794aedfa2d2c0b24455e3f3f7fb87813e9d1679ab5457e7592aab1cd201", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ！\nレッスンを始める前に、大事な話があるんだ。", "zh": "大家，让你们久等了！\n在开始练习之前，有件重要的事要跟你们说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "a352dbb5e19fe8ede9f7189c7f328f183a576f6051db44150bce091c1f21d063", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nあの、大事な話って……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n那个，重要的事是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1007_p", "source_sha256": "79e3e658f99c0fb1fd22d01c14695a439e7443e32d51d7de2987f4bd7cc72a40", "ja": "ああ。\n急な話で、俺も驚いているんだけど。実は……。", "zh": "啊。事情来得太突然，我也很惊讶。其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "aff3cf41762d9b6a3ee38faf1c77885af054705aeeca6b97aa31227ddf461c2b", "ja": "まぁ……ではその、『ミレニアム芸術文化賞』の\n今年の受賞者が、わたくしたちになったんですの？", "zh": "哎呀……那么，今年的“千禧年艺术文化奖”\n获奖者，变成我们了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "abf31dafde9b30ced309fce75d4993e844317a16d465ef76f0d2eee1689e34b0", "ja": "『ミレニアム芸術文化賞』……文学、芸術、音楽など、\n様々な分野で活躍した方に贈られる賞ですわね。", "zh": "“千禧年艺术文化奖”……是颁发给在文学、艺术、音乐等各个领域活跃人士的奖项呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1010_p", "source_sha256": "486845533687a341f598e4b111503c1b10f660666a07639ef26a476938c7b731", "ja": "はい。文化芸術を広める事に貢献したという事で、\n765プロのアイドル達が選ばれたそうです。", "zh": "是的。据说，765事务所的偶像们因为为推广文化艺术作出了贡献而当选了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "69ee5f8b141eca06ff6c1cfc508d269c10f726681de457fb58c76d65ba9d6d94", "ja": "その賞なら、私も知ってるよーっ！\nバレエで選ばれた人もいるからね☆", "zh": "那个奖的话，我也知道哦——！\n因为也有凭芭蕾获选的人嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "8f249257e8598260e8e31e9f9817e2c5b97395865d83e0ceff7c4e3b81b3ca77", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n杏奈たちの、活動も……芸術……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n安娜她们的活动，也算是……艺术……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e9f5f3200bb41bd76256b7fb0f33f39eee3062eae87397e74d6048d8abfc1a43", "ja": "そうだな……今回は、特に『産声とクラブ』や、\n全国ツアーの試みが評価されたらしい。", "zh": "是啊……听说这次，尤其是《産声とクラブ》和全国巡演的尝试得到了认可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7d63543ddccde16c765e84c81854c1239f6032734ae26f715c17d80f04ce595a", "ja": "中央エリア駅前のチア活動も、地方を活性化させた\nという事で、かなり評価されているらしいぞ。", "zh": "中央区域车站前的啦啦队活动，也因为带动了地方活力，据说得到了相当高的评价。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "7625ee337616a3d717d0ac5b98452a170c5a197bd5ad1b4665ad3cc716cf4822", "ja": "チア活動は、私と杏奈ちゃんも出てましたけど……\n芸術なんて言われると、なんだか照れちゃうね？", "zh": "啦啦队活动我和杏奈也参加了……  \n被称为艺术什么的，总觉得有点害羞呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "d2d43db2f2268d3b07f31ac245a40496dea2704f1252df67a2c0534e437dec62", "ja": "ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c870958878918ad6d9104409cd73e2dd0c03085ab244e76d067db58d99fbe874", "ja": "それで、ここからが本題なんだが……授賞式は、\n代表で星梨花に出席して欲しいとの事だ。", "zh": "那么，接下来才是正题……对方希望由星梨花代表出席颁奖典礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "34868b86566471123743f7ce290395efadba4258b570dd612d63e6f276fe2331", "ja": "えっ！？　わ、わたしですか？", "zh": "诶！？　我、我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a762a54808166601c83f8980b82afa679ba77284cf71802feec64eb742b19508", "ja": "ああ。選考委員のひとりが、星梨花と知り合いだとか。\n……この人なんだけど、知ってるか？", "zh": "啊。据说评选委员中有一位是星梨花的熟人。\n……就是这个人，你认识吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "037228b712a2c352c8233f584376c236c4d92991b698226e146b60cd04c95a30", "ja": "あっ。はい、パパのお友達で……\n先週、わたしの家のお茶会にいらしてました。", "zh": "啊。是的，他是爸爸的朋友……上周还来我家参加茶会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "7941b82a4abb4b5b0c6870a466520f2f5a8a64716289ea59e698899825dd4c14", "ja": "その時に、パパに言われて、『産声とクラブ』の\n映像を見てもらったんですけど……。", "zh": "就是那时候，爸爸让我请他看了《初啼与俱乐部》的影像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d62b57b8850601460d016bd85921e0a6936f9844400a15eaf6ce1a2aef183e59", "ja": "なるほど……そういう事だったんだな。\n繋がったよ。", "zh": "原来如此……是这么回事啊。\n我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "a7eb09a3fcfe2436d2ebaf6fcb65d6056c952092146412d1962a2d07309ab367", "ja": "じゃあ……賞を、もらったの……\n星梨花ちゃんが、きっかけ……？", "zh": "那么……我拿到奖，是因为星梨花……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "a2b85b99a69226d876e029a535bac20508d593c4b80ebb7a0499e1d06e9563e0", "ja": "それで、授賞式の代表にってことかぁ。\nそう考えると、自然かも？", "zh": "所以，是要让我作为颁奖仪式的代表吗？\n这么一想，好像也挺自然的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "a01f53c9151dcedb6d59468ef99a92d4a44fe034ea3e50465b42737ab4d1f372", "ja": "けど……わたしで、いいんでしょうか？", "zh": "不过……由我来代表，真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "8e245ed4339253a7ca7dac1e8f359015b070158c07e52bd2323dff2b81af4587", "ja": "『産声とクラブ』を歌ったのは、\nわたしだけじゃありません。それに……。", "zh": "演唱《初啼与俱乐部》的，也不只是我一个人。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "56a3ff9dbb703b5e31f4eec325a50b65103c4659df91939a3a9ee16d1a878113", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、せりりん！\n代表としてもらってきてよ！", "zh": "没事的，星梨花！\n你就作为代表去领回来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "702fe6cf7676c83d144a0d0d6d6494795b65f36a7a1f9e9c030795af8d40563d", "ja": "海美さん……。", "zh": "海美小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1029_p", "source_sha256": "14c44cdc6b25152c9a3013492403031deb481f0ca8182c340ceb147a50ab9007", "ja": "受賞したのは765プロのみんなで、代表として\n星梨花が受け取るだけだ。何も変じゃないよ。", "zh": "获奖的是765Pro的大家，星梨花只是作为代表上台领奖而已。没什么奇怪的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1030_p", "source_sha256": "079bbd23d749f33627da568f0f10c725aeb356f6340273c5272fad5f73550d21", "ja": "授賞式は定期公演の後だけど……それもあって、\n選考委員の人達が、公演を見学に来るそうだ。", "zh": "颁奖仪式是在定期公演之后……也正因为如此，听说评选委员们要来观看公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "e535b0ced1527bf69ab9d4e296f4809ccfaab382abf986042203809b01554fee", "ja": "まあ、なんだか大事になってきましたわね。\nでは公演でも、受賞についてのMCを？", "zh": "哎呀，事情好像变得重要起来了呢。那么，演出时也要进行关于获奖的MC吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1032_p", "source_sha256": "db81a3e8952a7d9d44ab7a7f80812a038f3917687954e9744fe7f55f21cbc2ea", "ja": "はい。星梨花に、受賞に関するちょっとした\nスピーチをやってもらおうかと。", "zh": "是的。我想让星梨花简单说几句获奖感言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1033_p", "source_sha256": "256d7977fabbaeff5818a4a410658371ede538d9ff7d6b2d9bcdb0136201804b", "ja": "内容は、星梨花に考えてもらおうと思ってるんだけど\n……それで構わないか？", "zh": "内容我想让星梨花自己想……这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "a695e7d756080554251828e3bf0cb80c6ed0adccc81fdd345a1c8cff9aa8dcfc", "ja": "スピーチ……わかりました。\nわたし、がんばります！", "zh": "演讲……我明白了。\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1035_p", "source_sha256": "7efca5fd457a7c0c964cc3da5b67c99a21c24dbb78515aab4f1bdb97cdca7829", "ja": "公演自体は、いつもどおりの予定だ。\n新曲お披露目もあるし、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "演出本身和往常一样。\n还有新曲的首次亮相，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "b78f277f7942a9f9f564f0134d882f6e924dec4f954011611caaeef224f33b39", "ja": "定期公演のセンターに、スピーチ……授賞式も……。\n星梨花ちゃん……やること多くて、大変……。", "zh": "定期公演的C位、致辞……还有颁奖典礼……\n星梨花……要做的事好多，真不容易……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "151bddbf24fc28fc5d25bedbd74508e022b8a2c06f934d90003c89952cb65713", "ja": "せりりんの負担が多くならないよう、私たちで\nサポートしないとね！　がんばるぞーっ！", "zh": "为了不让星梨花的负担变重，我们要好好支持她才行！  \n加油——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "86c29a05f05c3ce97a2946e08a70b8c99a8bd05d86064e915b5ce3dc4417b0fa", "ja": "うん！　星梨花ちゃんが集中できるように、\n私たちでしっかり支えるからね！", "zh": "嗯！为了让星梨花能够集中精神，我们会好好支持她的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "49395745f2a5d1db6524fe9d6303b88cdff8260f10b20ad00488c79db7111066", "ja": "みなさん……\nはい、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "大家……\n好的，谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1041_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "9c3efc289a51aca2adc7f49dd3c21fc94f0136127dac49f6d97f4ecb5ed54b94", "ja": "うーん。劇場の話もしたいけど、あんまり多いと\n時間が……スピーチって、難しいなぁ。", "zh": "嗯——虽然也想聊聊剧场的事，但要是说得太多，时间就……演讲真难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "4f90ad3d459019325abbe051e6041c37fc6728b36f98efd0f2245ebf393ae2f7", "ja": "今度の定期公演、{$P$}さんは、\nいつもどおりの公演にするって言ってたけど……。", "zh": "下次的定期公演，{$P$}先生说要像往常一样举办，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "442aa1c8c52a41f54912678691a3e038738611624908834400da37dbdeb786a9", "ja": "でも、特別なお客様が来るのに……それでいいのかな？", "zh": "可是，明明会有特别的客人来……这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1045_022ser", "source_sha256": "3358b283e37ee9bf8a7f26e3f394bc792912525584ac6ed3eb65e57079a77bc9", "ja": "やっぱり、{$P$}さんに\n相談してみよう……！", "zh": "果然，还是去找{$P$}先生商量一下吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1046_p", "source_sha256": "eb5b8d5ee7eddd7b239abeb9e9cb49e65390b82fd1b45c1ae517969da206db33", "ja": "なるほど。特別なお客さんが来るなら、\n特別なおもてなしが必要、か。", "zh": "原来如此。如果有特别的客人要来，就需要特别的招待，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1047_022ser", "source_sha256": "629b8316bae6b1f3906065d05623994610b39ab54da7b5237aecce306b11b793", "ja": "は、はい。この前、家で\nお茶会をしたんですけど……。", "zh": "是、是的。前段时间我在家里举办了茶会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1048_022ser", "source_sha256": "6bb9ba22e490d6c21e97adec67773addb9724c50cf31c8c1cfb9e8adadd6560a", "ja": "その時も、きちんとおもてなしできるように、\nたくさん準備や練習をしたんです。だから……。", "zh": "那时候，为了也能好好招待大家，我做了很多准备和练习。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1049_p", "source_sha256": "ad502ff303375462e7a5f11659b75d468326b3157d592aedebea7fe66db04289", "ja": "そうだな。定期公演は、いつもやってるものだから……\nっていう答えじゃ、星梨花はきっと納得できないよな。", "zh": "是啊。定期公演是一直都会举办的活动，所以……\n\n要是这么回答的话，星梨花肯定不会满意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1050_022ser", "source_sha256": "770c2f490cf0006f5bf22a3b2b2d457f70f61e28872f34e2c91d864c6a5d6d58", "ja": "はい……。{$P$}さん、\nどうしていつもどおりがいいんですか？", "zh": "是的……{$P$}先生，为什么照平时那样就好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1051_p", "source_sha256": "ce2d483f67932cd299028c48bc3dbc48f17e8fdc7de3b456e74d52886ce35d3d", "ja": "口で言うより、見てもらったほうが早いかもな。\n星梨花、ちょっと着いてきてくれるか？", "zh": "与其用嘴说，还是让你亲眼看看更快吧。\n星梨花，能跟我来一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1052_022ser", "source_sha256": "774ddba0a16639d74536f6f3274aba385569905df2caa5b9e47a051632ab50bd", "ja": "？　{$P$}さん、どこへ……？", "zh": "？　{$P$}先生，要去哪里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1053_p", "source_sha256": "4f773efd5a81b025a25359379e562f07d6906a29bfb654b08dd26fdf114dc82c", "ja": "もちろん。みんなのところだよ。", "zh": "当然是去大家那边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1054_utanosensei", "source_sha256": "4aab803bb7e021c7e11f38477300cc0e7110006a705b176d99394e31434367be", "ja": "二階堂さん、OKです！　休憩していてください。\n次は望月さん、お願いします。", "zh": "二阶堂小姐，没问题！请先休息一下。\n接下来拜托望月小姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1055_038chz", "source_sha256": "be2034aa3ce86f9d6fc14194851375c74112fd328036b0622d81430d70278193", "ja": "ありがとうございました！\n……がんばってくださいましね、杏奈。", "zh": "非常感谢！\n……请加油哦，杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1056_024ann", "source_sha256": "1906b12539014569bcafdd78ddf94dcf9384a0b254a4abf346d395b51910d875", "ja": "うん……！\n先生、よろしくお願いしまーすっ！", "zh": "嗯……！\n老师，请多关照啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1057_038chz", "source_sha256": "1a863c74afea0d00de07021fa383be1a603f57ad84ccf231af810f1cde322675", "ja": "その間に、わたくしは昨日の続きを……。\nええと、何ページだったかしら。", "zh": "这段时间，我先继续看昨天的内容……  \n嗯，是第几页来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1058_038chz", "source_sha256": "da975bb451e7731738f2cc57931667566c83af2c7b6bf78d4a152bb18d4d8236", "ja": "「私はバッドエンドなんて嫌！　生き残ってみせる！」\n……違いますわね。悪役令嬢なら、もっとこう……。", "zh": "“我才不要什么坏结局！我一定会活下去的！”\n……不对呢。反派千金的话，应该更加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1059_022ser", "source_sha256": "3b02509917f535d9d69f61f91f134df5a49478692085b8f40192250a513316e0", "ja": "千鶴さん……あれは、新しいお仕事の台本ですよね？\n休憩時間なのに、台本を読んでいるんですか？", "zh": "千鹤小姐……那是新工作的剧本吧？\n明明是休息时间，你还在看剧本吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1060_p", "source_sha256": "5d6c4aeb9362b5b359fb6104d3f0bf19b24e01231c7346e4c701672ac0018c4f", "ja": "公演以外に、個人の仕事もあるからな。\n時間を無駄にしないようにしてるんだろう。", "zh": "除了演出以外，还有个人工作。\n她应该是不想浪费时间吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1061_024ann", "source_sha256": "3929616ea3e7faa84d9e268019b0afb262e4e4adf4d07604ce653178546a27a7", "ja": "先生～！　杏奈、ちょっと音がズレちゃった……！\nこういう時、どうしたらいい！？", "zh": "老师～！杏奈刚才有个音跑调了……！\n这种时候该怎么办才好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1062_utanosensei", "source_sha256": "35beef7b7b97f985930abdd90c9972202d39cea2a8345c8268238e7e8dbb80c5", "ja": "そうね、ここは……。", "zh": "是啊，这里要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1063_022ser", "source_sha256": "719dd3fe67db5fc4ad2e251966d3463ccc4b364b11a3219206005780f077af15", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、音がずれたなんて、気付きませんでした。\nすごく上手に歌えてたのに……。", "zh": "安娜，我都没注意到你有走音。明明唱得那么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1064_p", "source_sha256": "0dea7a2fb8b59a1cd0accf09c8123d6e2606fdc2de558e917d4681a5dfd1ada8", "ja": "うん、そうだな。でも周りは気づかなくても、\n本人は気づいたし、直したいんだろうな。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。不过就算周围的人没注意到，本人也察觉到了，所以想改正吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1066_p", "source_sha256": "391e48ff96da0d38e5d7af91396bbd5e098a6b2d90a77160a28831f5a95e4a26", "ja": "さて、移動しようか。\nええと、海美は……。", "zh": "那么，移动吧。\n呃，海美她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1067_029umi", "source_sha256": "aae94abdb6a04103c0bdbfb30f9f5ecd8226f7b93c5e664af027489e621cfec4", "ja": "よしっ、ここまでは完璧っ！\nあとはこっちのステップを……。", "zh": "好！到这里都完美无缺！\n接下来是这边的舞步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1068_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1069_p", "source_sha256": "b4412776d7424b9349c117e7c602b6afa9ae0bece7945bfdd30d4f0572368807", "ja": "海美、お疲れさま。\nダンスの自主レッスンか？", "zh": "海美，辛苦了。\n是在自主练习舞蹈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1070_029umi", "source_sha256": "a9252bee8b86f67e18f46d45795f44bdf2ad5f7dabc3fc6db98b1b8f1cbf08b6", "ja": "あれっ？　せりりんと{$P$}？\nせりりん、今日、レッスンお休みじゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "咦？小星和{$P$}？\n小星，今天不是不用练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1071_022ser", "source_sha256": "a04484582c56f985379c51defce188034f246026f11b6555e39fb60c6a9b0246", "ja": "海美さんこそ、お休みのはずじゃ……。それに、\nダンスはもう全部覚えたって言ってましたよね？", "zh": "海美姐姐才是，应该休息才对吧……而且，您不是说已经把舞蹈全都记住了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1072_029umi", "source_sha256": "7d227db1a7a1bced7ef584c0b93331e3657375cc32463275af30d2d52b6fa86a", "ja": "うん！　でもついでだから、\nみんなの分も覚えておこうと思って。", "zh": "嗯！不过正好有空，我就想着把大家的部分也一起记下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1073_029umi", "source_sha256": "846a496fe8f13f295757b483793a432761496c6309037298002ef6b4c4958a5f", "ja": "そしたら先生がいなくても、\nいつでも教えてあげられるしねっ☆", "zh": "这样一来，就算老师不在，\n我也能随时教大家了嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1074_022ser", "source_sha256": "610d93f13b5bc8db398984ab66d9e418323df68a92f67b7d620023da5701d5ce", "ja": "ええっ！？\nでも、海美さんが大変なんじゃ……。", "zh": "诶诶！？\n可是，这样海美姐姐不是会很辛苦吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1075_029umi", "source_sha256": "18e89f14972484fa492eda2e8604f85998cf21552fc57bfd94fb7ec1fd7726fc", "ja": "私なら平気だよ！　それに、無理すると\n{$P$}に怒られるし！", "zh": "我没事啦！而且要是逞强的话，{$P$}会生气的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1076_p", "source_sha256": "ba341ca70eab091c16f911a37714b63bf3f2bf3d4cca5e62c705305859f1e08c", "ja": "それがわかっているなら、大丈夫だな！\n……お、春香が来たみたいだ。", "zh": "既然你明白这一点，那就没问题了！\n……哦，春香好像来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1077_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1078_001har", "source_sha256": "ed9a0ffdfbf8dfc8f1a2ea3ab31017901dc1de7b9206ecb325be757b66d93dd4", "ja": "海美ちゃん、お待たせ～！　……あれ？\n星梨花ちゃんと、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "海美，久等啦～！……咦？\n还有星梨花和{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1079_p", "source_sha256": "b9f30d6d1c86e09463e8e72a713e6cebd55bf444802baf067df1524a6bd8bac1", "ja": "おかえり、春香。今日は\n『アイグラ！！』の撮影だったよな。どうだった？", "zh": "欢迎回来，春香。今天是拍摄《偶像写真！！》吧。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1080_001har", "source_sha256": "caecc10d0e7e5600f248e2a59ea97b88f4ab5cae0a78589f87784b1ff16b99cc", "ja": "はい、バッチリです！　カメラマンさんにも、\nすごく良い写真が撮れたってほめてもらえましたよ！", "zh": "是的，非常顺利！摄影师也夸我，说拍到了特别棒的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1081_001har", "source_sha256": "a3318267e2548c9dc665dcb265e725909368c8f812f07499255ea9b1846ce215", "ja": "海美ちゃんにダンスを教えてもらう約束をしてたので、\n急いで帰ってきたんですけど……何かありましたか？", "zh": "因为我和海美约好了要请她教我跳舞，所以就赶紧回来了……是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1082_p", "source_sha256": "51cca77401d843e88912621b832258c3ead9a63b6af2f21cc5e6b414d5ffe571", "ja": "いや、何もないよ。ふたりとも、\n無理せず、怪我のないようにな。", "zh": "没什么。你们两个，别勉强自己，注意不要受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1083_001har", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1084_029umi", "source_sha256": "e1eb19d5b326530bce2076304186937525a34d71d3e7c2e77efd419b208eb87a", "ja": "は～いっ！", "zh": "好～的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1086_p", "source_sha256": "81b009ad8a834e0320423933bdfd0fa7a1a5f342623dee9b1454b9388e4c171c", "ja": "さて……ひととおり回ってみたけど、\n星梨花、どうだった？", "zh": "那么……差不多都逛了一遍，星梨花，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1087_022ser", "source_sha256": "237420ad009837fe5d6a17bc11eb6920d0b4aec740a074e224e237e2894fc9f8", "ja": "はい！　……みんなすごいって、\n改めて思いました。", "zh": "是的！……我再次觉得，大家都好厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1088_022ser", "source_sha256": "09d462146c74baeacebf21378925c2b67cadbe4e17f61be63733294ea42fb2a8", "ja": "定期公演のレッスンも、他のお仕事も、\n当たり前のようにこなしていて……。", "zh": "定期公演的练习和其他工作，\n都像理所当然一样完成得很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1089_p", "source_sha256": "71b36589c8f856e0a51c159306eec2f2d8932b8757757323cd1d55d3d6fd85bc", "ja": "そうだな。\nそしてこれは、劇場のいつもの景色だ。", "zh": "是啊。\n而这也是剧场一如往常的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1090_022ser", "source_sha256": "fc872714e8e1779690e70665c6a1ee54a063d73f93ba44da72f57c20d378553e", "ja": "言われてみれば……。", "zh": "听你这么一说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1091_p", "source_sha256": "1249f537a1b98b760df6af88be5310d9c2a8fdec1d65da74ddf3c73cbb8954c8", "ja": "みんな、いつもどおり頑張っている。\n結果はステージの上で見せる。アイドルだからな。", "zh": "大家和平常一样在努力。\n结果会在舞台上展现出来。毕竟是偶像嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1092_p", "source_sha256": "11e2b7c545023dfb76860e4ab63d37aec7de4d3e234702623cd42bf8d747cdce", "ja": "星梨花も、初めてのセンター公演の時に言ってただろ？\n「特別じゃなくていい」って。", "zh": "星梨花在第一次担任C位公演时也说过吧？\n“没必要特别。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1093_022ser", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1094_022ser", "source_sha256": "8d0e36526c01819bfd74802bc55ec91424bd7a705fca785bf67092bc975ffa8f", "ja": "わたし、そう言ってました……。\nでも……。", "zh": "我……确实那么说过……\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1095_022ser", "source_sha256": "4de5c0f35d67c9e03ba7332f2e1ef3d9f94867dbb238d807621829e36510f90a", "ja": "今回は、いつもどおりじゃダメな気がしたんです。\n特別でなくちゃって……どうしてなんでしょう？", "zh": "这次，我觉得像平时那样是不行的。\n一定要特别才行……这是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1096_p", "source_sha256": "b13661f35a15e39903ca40da8dc5f1667ff71a8d4b7459fd496855a97a845937", "ja": "そうだな……特別なお客さん、っていう事も\nあるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "是啊……也许是因为这次的客人很特别……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1097_p", "source_sha256": "7ae8c69636e6aca23c09f42cea99744854b4328626651874d03e73ed3f784477", "ja": "一番は、星梨花が成長したからかもしれないな。\n上を目指す欲が出てきた、という事だと思う。", "zh": "最重要的原因，或许是星梨花成长了吧。\n我想，她是开始有了追求更高目标的欲望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1098_022ser", "source_sha256": "94ab1e688db3ffe2face260af53ffc1a22560501df304c844def16699c510250", "ja": "上を目指す欲……。", "zh": "想要更上一层楼的欲望……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1099_022ser", "source_sha256": "1eec40287758f55317f9e69aeea3bd3d2341e40e4fe49d8389492372e80c1874", "ja": "{$P$}さん。それって、\nいいことなんでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。那\n是一件好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1100_p", "source_sha256": "4d97b980d9f592d73c15188a7bf11a37ebd964f15a570fe0402c2646d428eb8d", "ja": "向上心を持つ事自体は、悪い事じゃない。でも、\n苦しい思いをする事も増えるかもしれないな。", "zh": "有上进心这件事本身，并不是什么坏事。不过，\n可能也会遇到更多痛苦的时候吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1102_p", "source_sha256": "4c4c622734fc4e2c839184ea76ad5d9d81675b0af727e34271ecb63bf83899fe", "ja": "だからこそ、忘れないで欲しいんだ。", "zh": "正因为如此，我希望你不要忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1103_p", "source_sha256": "45f47daace801f59b1e2bb8fd2782afd907e7d25ceff9b6a60355206e1216eaa", "ja": "星梨花やみんなが当たり前だと思っているものは、\n当たり前じゃない。ひとつひとつが積み重ねなんだよ。", "zh": "星梨花和大家习以为常的那些东西，\n并不是理所当然的。那都是一点一滴积累起来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1104_022ser", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1105_022ser", "source_sha256": "c1f4196bc259e9c2b30dccd1ea26658e46820aa794dcfef5c677b93b3043b9e8", "ja": "わたしたちはみんな、いつも。お客さんに\n見てもらうために、がんばっているから……。", "zh": "我们大家一直都在为了让观众看到，\n而努力着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1106_022ser", "source_sha256": "abf766a11a5a42d64901ab497df8a7423cc751c68b51acdd7f4679d478f03216", "ja": "だから、『いつもどおり』……なんですね？", "zh": "所以，“一如往常”……就是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1107_p", "source_sha256": "1a5b9166d777953284df96ae536a4b6bebd559685efc5c7926c2b5b37e0122d3", "ja": "ああ。……答えになったかな？", "zh": "嗯……这样算是回答了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1108_022ser", "source_sha256": "51bd3057cbccfcf6e75109423f2f2d738cf91ddf5ca6ed81ca8d66bb7e34ce7f", "ja": "はい。……ありがとうございました。\nわたし、もう一回、考えてみます。", "zh": "好的……谢谢您。\n我会再认真想一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1109_022ser", "source_sha256": "58cc253bba95454a3653927826493f93523ac62195f9fd495556d730c0ee1d45", "ja": "{$P$}さん。スピーチの文章が\n書けたら、見てもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。等演讲稿\n写好以后，能请您帮我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1110_p", "source_sha256": "097d0c34dbf9963e20debeb2363393e73b7c510fc0b7fd5af2c937741726d4ba", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\n楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "啊，当然可以。\n我很期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1111_null", "source_sha256": "d87e9f16b90b98f4767a8533867e6c4c00d2ff8e4cd1137f3009e6c70f20fb56", "ja": "公演当日……", "zh": "公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1112_p", "source_sha256": "ef35f27c8f754abc51656791c1b382a772933ed0e874639791d82598c834e32e", "ja": "（選考委員の人達の席……後ろの方にいるのは、\nもしかして星梨花のお父さん……？）", "zh": "（选拔委员们的座位……坐在后面的那个人，难道是星梨花的爸爸……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1113_p", "source_sha256": "983bef5a9f4ebb98ff31d5bdb836d902f8ad0ea9c0e8367ef562a9d7c332821d", "ja": "（星梨花は何も言ってなかったから……\n内緒で観に来たのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（星梨花什么都没说过……\n也许是瞒着她来看的吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1114_022ser", "source_sha256": "2bc17b4cfaba2524d4b252f4b4b55c29c0a882d7aa3d2acd78eb3cd890c381e8", "ja": "次の曲に行く前に……\nみなさん、もうご存知かもしれませんが。", "zh": "在进入下一首歌之前……\n大家可能已经知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1115_022ser", "source_sha256": "35e340c3aca9de3d771961ab6d5b6282e1343a21c6fa1ce57ce192205ced9a49", "ja": "わたしたち765プロのアイドルが、この度、\n『ミレニアム芸術文化賞』をいただきました！", "zh": "我们这765位专业偶像，这次获得了《千禧艺术文化奖》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1116_audience", "source_sha256": "29804ec313346fa7cd59236f151b72b1a1dcdf7b0baf30265fde39201ce6714a", "ja": "ワァアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1117_022ser", "source_sha256": "58d6288b09ca2e0f7b3b9545958572da073936e31a90789f9dbe0fd43e2ef551", "ja": "わたしたちの新しい挑戦をたくさんの方に\n評価していただけて、とってもうれしいです！", "zh": "我们的全新挑战能得到这么多人的认可，我真的非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1119_022ser", "source_sha256": "b1e90488ce2b9ecfd2e115a72a9ed729a81fa9f2980d6127febf94d26d328490", "ja": "わたしたちのツアーは、全国のみなさんに、\n『劇場の良さを知ってもらう』ことが始まりでした……", "zh": "我们的巡演，最初是希望让全国各地的大家，\n都能了解剧场的美好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1120_022ser", "source_sha256": "c6deababd1c0a7160f61762d6676ac91e7614bf1b9893015f5e9a75d61343ec6", "ja": "劇場は、わたしにとってかけがえのない場所です。\nみなさんにとっても、そうだといいなって思います。", "zh": "剧场对我来说是无可替代的地方。\n我希望对大家来说，这里也是这样的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1121_022ser", "source_sha256": "01202e43b95bba6e0b62bf904e7dd4842a5082caa0c425b49e1e7507fbde0920", "ja": "だから今日も、『いつもどおり』の素敵な公演です！\n……みなさん、ようこそ、わたしたちの劇場へ！", "zh": "所以今天也是一场“和往常一样”的精彩公演！\n……欢迎大家来到我们的剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_115_1122_022ser", "source_sha256": "5ca2087d57dee0a007d5b3051e6a444969ec9cb1efc201bc89206b8dc3c8b99a", "ja": "いつもの場所から、新しい歌を届けます。聞いて\nください。『Come on a Tea Party!』！", "zh": "我们将从老地方，为大家献上崭新的歌曲。请听\n这首——《Come on a Tea Party!》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
